        "TileImage": "$($repository efb0894c-426e-4f66-9822-880d1e735047).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Bangkok\r\rYou have 4 Targets, but 1 additional bonus. The 4 Targets are former Anti-Furry Operatives. One really cares about skincare and hates fur, other two are disguised couples, and the other has his name closely related to that one particular and horrible American President. The bonus target is a stalker, kill him as you like, but only with an SMG. Client has a taste for some vengeance over the former anti-furries. But enough of that, avoid collateral damage and unwanted deaths.",
